# DTO Contract (verbatim — do not rename fields)

## Reporting
UnpaidInvoiceAgingDto, UnpaidInvoiceAgingRequest, UnpaidInvoiceAgingResponse,
MonthlyBillingDto, MonthlyBillingRequest, MonthlyBillingResponse,
ReportingOverviewResponse, AgingBucketSummary (0-29, 30-59, 60-89, 90+),
AgingReportSummaryResponse (healthStatus: Excellent|Good|Fair|Poor|Critical),
BillingKpiResponse (riskLevel: Low|Medium|High|Critical),
InvoiceAgingDetailDto.

## Matter Payer
GetMatterPayerDto, CreateMatterPayerRequest, UpdateMatterPayerRequest,
MatterPayerResponse, MatterPayerListResponse.
Fields: invoicePortion, sendCopy, billRecipient, relationshipType, isDefault.

## Matter Related Contact
GetMatterRelatedContactDto, CreateMatterRelatedContactRequest,
UpdateMatterRelatedContactRequest, MatterRelatedContactResponse,
MatterRelatedContactListResponse.
Fields: relationshipType, isDefaultRecipient, isActive.

## Case Trust Notification Recipient
GetCaseTrustNotificationRecipientDto,
CreateCaseTrustNotificationRecipientRequest,
UpdateCaseTrustNotificationRecipientRequest,
CaseTrustNotificationRecipientResponse,
CaseTrustNotificationRecipientListResponse.
Fields: isNotifiedRecipient, isActive.

## Management
GetManagementDto, UpdateManagementRequest.

## Client creation
CreateIndividualClientRequest, CreateCompanyClientRequest,
CreateTrusteeClientRequest, ClientDto.

## Envelope / errors
ApiResponse<T> (success, data, errors[]).
InvalidClientException, DuplicateClientException — map to typed Dart
exceptions; never let them surface as raw DioException.